## 2. Proposed Changes & Components

### Component 1: Data Models & Types (`src/types/v2.ts`)

#### [NEW] [v2.ts](file:///e:/Simlight_prototype/src/types/v2.ts)
- **`LiveVariable`**:
  - `id`: unique identifier (e.g. `'cash'`, `'inventory'`, `'satisfaction'`)
  - `label`: display name (e.g. `'Cash Available'`, `'Customer Satisfaction'`)
  - `unit`: `'currency'` (₹/$), `'percent'` (%), `'units'`, `'status'`, `'points'`
  - `initialValue`: starting value
  - `currentValue`: current numeric value
  - `min`, `max`, `step`: bounds
  - `category`: `'financial'` | `'operational'` | `'market'` | `'risk'` | `'reputation'`
  - `format`: `'currency_inr'` | `'currency_usd'` | `'percentage'` | `'compact_number'`

- **`DecisionComponent` (8 Types)**:
  1. `select`: Single / multi selection cards (e.g., Supplier A / B / C)
  2. `allocate`: Distribute a fixed budget/resource across N categories (e.g. ₹10L across Digital, TV, Influencer, Retail)
  3. `slider`: Continuous numeric lever (e.g. Price ₹80 – ₹150)
  4. `quantity`: Numerical stepper / order amount (e.g. 0 to 10,000 units)
  5. `ranking`: Priority ordering (e.g. Rank Quality, Cost, Delivery, Reliability)
  6. `budget`: Toggle investments or capital projects with cost caps
  7. `portfolio`: Select a portfolio of initiatives / products under risk & return limits
  8. `negotiation`: Negotiation strategy with tactics (Accept, Counteroffer, Threaten to switch, Long-term contract)

- **`SimulationRule` & `Consequence`**:
  - `condition`: Compound predicate (e.g., `decision.supplier == 'B' && decision.orderQty > 5000`)
  - `variableDeltas`: Array of modifications (e.g., `{ variableId: 'cash', op: 'add', value: -450000 }`, `{ variableId: 'reliability', op: 'percent_change', value: -12 }`)
  - `narrativeFeedback`: Descriptive trade-off statement (e.g., *"Supplier negotiation successful. Cost reduced by 5%, but delivery reliability declined."*)
  - `triggerEventId`: Optional event to trigger

- **`SimulationEvent`**:
  - `id`, `title`, `description`, `triggerType` (`'round'` | `'condition'` | `'random'`)
  - `probability`: 0 to 1.0
  - `impactDeltas`: Direct variable impacts
  - `badge`: `'disruption'` | `'market_shift'` | `'regulatory'` | `'opportunity'`

- **`SimulationRound`**:
  - `roundNumber`: 1 to N
  - `title`: e.g. "Supplier Disruption Crisis"
  - `situation`: Rich contextual narrative
  - `role`: e.g. "Supply Chain Manager"
  - `decisions`: Array of `DecisionComponent`
  - `rules`: Array of `SimulationRule`
  - `events`: Array of `SimulationEvent`

- **`V2Simulation`**:
  - `companyName`: e.g. "ABC Manufacturing Ltd."
  - `industry`: "Manufacturing" | "FMCG" | "Technology" | "Healthcare" | etc.
  - `scenarioOverview`: Context and objectives
  - `variables`: `LiveVariable[]`
  - `rounds`: `SimulationRound[]`
  - `templates`: Ready-to-load configurations

